      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This is the fundamental conflict between **distributive justice (need-based fairness for the individual) and utilitarian justice (greatest good for the whole community).**\n\nWhile a strong focus on economic \"impact\" can benefit the tax base, prioritizing that over absolute need can effectively push the neediest people further from crucial support systems like robust public\n\n **",
